# maic-leak-audit as a systemd user service, run by maic-leak-audit.timer (docs/audit-trail.md). Written by
# `maic audit-trail schedule install` from contrib/systemd/; `maic audit-trail schedule remove` takes it away.
[Unit]
Description=MAIC leak audit over the audit trail and session transcripts (local judge only)

[Service]
Type=oneshot
Environment=MAIC_BIN=@MAIC@
ExecStart=@EXEC@
Nice=10
